<title>USA: Moldova cancels tender for 35,000 T PL-480 wheat.</title>
<headline>Moldova cancels tender for 35,000 T PL-480 wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova cancelled a buying tender for 35,000 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat under the PL-480 program after taking offers on Tuesday, agents for the buyer said.</p>
<p>News was awaited on when it will re-tender, they added.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
